  "description": "Reid Method 2 | 20\" BMX bike\nTake your BMX riding to the next level with the Reid Bikes Method 2, a performance-focused 20\" BMX bike designed for riders aged 7+ years. Built for developing skills, tricks and confidence, it's ready for BMX parks, pump tracks, street riding and everything in between.\nThe Hi-Ten steel frame features modern BMX geometry with predictable handling, giving young riders a stable platform for practising manuals, jumps, whips and other BMX skills. A 20.75\" top tube, compact rear end and 9\" riser bars create a responsive and comfortable riding position.\nThe Reid Bikes Method 2 features upgrades including a sealed internal headset and gyro-compatible frame tabs. A seat-stay mounted U-brake and two-finger brake lever provide reliable control, helping riders confidently practise technical moves and tricks.\nBuilt for demanding BMX sessions, the Method 2 includes a forged alloy stem and seat clamp, 36-hole double-wall rims and a durable KMC chain. A 3-piece crankset, 25T x 9T gearing and cassette hub provide a durable, performance-focused drivetrain for riders progressing their BMX skills.\nFinished in black with bold red detailing, the Reid Bikes Method 2 delivers the durability and control young riders need to keep progressing.\nWho is the Reid Bikes Method 2 for?\nThe Method 2 BMX is ideal for:",
